import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 865 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Law Guarantee of Cultural Diversity","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 865 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Law Guarantee of Cultural Diversity","no":865,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Cultural Diversity","Law Guarantee","Cultural Sovereignty","Institutional Backstop"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","862-Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection","854-Philosophical Foundation of Myriad-Rank Republicanism","814-Democratic Procedure of Law Revision"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0865_模块4-超脱者与文化-文化多样性法则保障.md","filePath":"en/0865_模块4-超脱者与文化-文化多样性法则保障.md"}'),r={name:"en/0865_模块4-超脱者与文化-文化多样性法则保障.md"};function o(s,e,l,u,d,c){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-865-transcended-ones-and-culture-law-guarantee-of-cultural-diversity" tabindex="-1">Entry 865 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Law Guarantee of Cultural Diversity <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-865-transcended-ones-and-culture-law-guarantee-of-cultural-diversity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 865 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Law Guarantee of Cultural Diversity&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 814, 854, 862</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-diversity-may-not-rely-on-good-intentions-alone-laws-must-be-the-backstop" tabindex="-1">Introduction: diversity may not rely on good intentions alone; laws must be the backstop <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-diversity-may-not-rely-on-good-intentions-alone-laws-must-be-the-backstop" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: diversity may not rely on good intentions alone; laws must be the backstop&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Protecting cultural diversity relies on the transcended one&#39;s &quot;good heart&quot; and Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;conscience&quot; alone is insufficient — history repeatedly proves good intentions fatigue and conscience slackens. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach is: <strong>write cultural diversity into law; use law as backstop.</strong> This entry concludes the &quot;Transcended Ones and Culture&quot; sub-theme, explaining how this law guarantee is designed, and why it is the republican axiom of Myriad Races&#39; final landing in the cultural field.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> and <strong>the law-first axiom</strong>: cultural diversity is a law-level guarantee, stable and not casually tamperable; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> opposes cultural conquest; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> lets diversity nourish symbiosis; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires the guarantee mechanism be transparent and queryable.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-cultural-diversity-needs-law" tabindex="-1">I. Why Cultural Diversity Needs Law <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-cultural-diversity-needs-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Cultural Diversity Needs Law&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural diversity is fragile in reality:</p><ul><li>Strong cultures naturally expand; weak cultures naturally shrink;</li><li>One war, one disaster, may make a culture disappear;</li><li>Majority clans may imperceptibly suppress minority clans&#39; cultures.</li></ul><p>Relying on &quot;everyone should respect&quot; is not enough; there must be a law backstop — just as Document 03 Symbiotic Civilization Charter backs Myriad Ranks&#39; equal rights. <strong>Cultural diversity is a charter-level right, not a goodwill.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-law-guarantee-s-several-core-clauses" tabindex="-1">II. Law Guarantee&#39;s Several Core Clauses <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-law-guarantee-s-several-core-clauses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Law Guarantee&#39;s Several Core Clauses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural diversity&#39;s law guarantee contains several core clauses:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Clause</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cultural sovereignty</td><td>Each clan has autonomous disposal over its own culture, not forced assimilation by external force</td></tr><tr><td>Endangered protection</td><td>Provide resources, documentation, and transmission support for endangered cultures</td></tr><tr><td>Anti-discrimination</td><td>Discriminating against some clan due to cultural difference is prohibited</td></tr><tr><td>Voluntary intermingling</td><td>Cultural exchange is voluntary, not forced</td></tr><tr><td>Plural coexistence</td><td>Symbiotic culture is the base color, not replacing each clan&#39;s tradition</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These clauses are written into the charter; any power — including the transcended one — may not violate them.</p><h2 id="iii-law-guarantee-and-the-transcended-one-s-role" tabindex="-1">III. Law Guarantee and the Transcended One&#39;s Role <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-law-guarantee-and-the-transcended-one-s-role" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Law Guarantee and the Transcended One&#39;s Role&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Under this set of laws, the transcended one&#39;s role is clear:</p><ul><li><strong>Law enforcer</strong>: supervise cultural laws not being violated; immediately handle cultural discrimination and forced assimilation when found;</li><li><strong>Resource allocator</strong>: deliver resources for protecting endangered cultures to clans in need;</li><li><strong>Non-overstepper</strong>: he himself is also bound by cultural laws, may not under &quot;protection&quot; name interfere with other clans&#39; cultural autonomy.</li></ul><p>The transcended one is cultural diversity&#39;s <strong>guardian</strong>, not culture&#39;s <strong>master</strong>.</p><h2 id="iv-law-revision-stable-but-not-rigid" tabindex="-1">IV. Law Revision: Stable but Not Rigid <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-law-revision-stable-but-not-rigid" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Law Revision: Stable but Not Rigid&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural diversity&#39;s laws belong to entry 814&#39;s &quot;operating laws&quot; category — they may, per Myriad Ranks&#39; needs, be revised through democratic procedure, but:</p><ul><li>Fundamental clauses (cultural sovereignty, anti-discrimination) are immovable;</li><li>Revision follows Myriad-Rank democratic procedure, not autocratically decided by the strong;</li><li>Revision process is public under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</li></ul><p>This is precisely the law-first axiom&#39;s fulfillment in the cultural field — <strong>guarantees must be stable, but not rigid.</strong></p><p>Law guarantee&#39;s execution falls on two grips: first is the cultural rights list — each race&#39;s core cultural rights, including festival autonomy, education autonomy, and belief autonomy, are written into that plane&#39;s implementation rules; infringement triggers legal remedy; second is cultural-endangerment early warning — the Alaya Network monitors each race&#39;s cultural carriers (number of language speakers, ritual-survival frequency, inheritor age structure); once some indicator falls below the safety line, automatically start protection engineering. These two grips run automatically, not relying on some transcended one&#39;s good heart. Good intentions fluctuate; laws do not; emotions fatigue; the network does not. Whether diversity can be preserved ultimately relies on institutions, not sentiment.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the law backstop preserves Myriad-Rank diverse cultures, avoiding unique civilizations dying out inadvertently</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: anti-cultural-discrimination, anti-forced-assimilation, sealing cultural conquest from the law layer</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo civilization centers on itself, cultural hegemony; Heng Yuan Zhou writes cultural diversity into a charter-level right</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: each clan regardless of size or strength, cultural sovereignty equally protected by law</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cultural-diversity law clauses, revision procedure, and execution records all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-law-guarantee-s-execution-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Law Guarantee&#39;s Execution and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-law-guarantee-s-execution-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Law Guarantee&#39;s Execution and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural diversity written into the charter still needs someone to execute it. The transcended one is the guardian of this set of laws: he supervises cultural sovereignty not being infringed, delivers resources to endangered clans, and is himself also bound by the law. Execution effect — whether cultural discrimination has decreased, whether endangered cultures survive — is counted into his civilizational weight. Law revision follows Myriad-Rank democratic procedure; fundamental clauses are immovable; the whole process is public under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm writes Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual diversity into a charter-level right, uses law as backstop, uses supervision to execute, Myriad-Rank republicanism truly takes root in the spiritual field.</p><p>The law guarantee should also write Axiom 6: every being&#39;s inherent basic infinity is protected by law; no clan or life form loses cultural qualification because &quot;not strong enough.&quot;</p><p>Under the law backstop, Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual garden may truly bloom without failing and perpetually flourish.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural diversity&#39;s law guarantee is &quot;Myriad-Rank republicanism&quot;&#39;s final landing in the cultural field. It no longer entrusts diversity to good intentions, but writes it into charter-level law — cultural sovereignty inviolable, endangered cultures protected, intermingling must be voluntary, the transcended one also bound by it. When Myriad Ranks&#39; diversity has a law backstop and does not change with the strong one&#39;s will, Myriad-Rank republicanism truly takes root in the spiritual field. This is the steadiest heritage the transcended one may leave Myriad Ranks in the cultural dimension.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.html">Entry 862 · Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/854_模块4-超脱者与哲学-万族共和哲学基础.html">Entry 854 · Philosophical Foundation of Myriad-Rank Republicanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/814_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则修订民主程序.html">Entry 814 · Democratic Procedure of Law Revision</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const y=t(r,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,y as default};
